# Folder Structure Rules (BẮT BUỘC)

## 📂 Root Folders
- `apps/` - Applications (frontend)
- `services/` - Backend microservices
- `libs/` - Shared libraries
- `packages/` - Frontend shared packages
- `infrastructure/` - IaC (Terraform, Helm, ArgoCD)
- `docs/` - Documentation
- `database/` - Migrations, seeds
- `tests/` - E2E, performance tests
- `scripts/` - DevOps scripts

## 🎨 Frontend (`apps/web/`)
- `src/components/{domain}/` - Component theo domain (auth, course, exam, ai, blockchain)
- `src/pages/{role}/` - Pages theo role (auth, public, student, instructor, admin, error)
- `src/hooks/` - Custom hooks
- `src/services/api/` - API clients
- `src/services/websocket/` - WebSocket clients
- `src/utils/` - Helpers
- `src/types/` - TypeScript types
- `src/app/providers/` - Context providers
- `src/app/router/` - Routing config
- `src/app/store/` - Global state (Zustand)
- `src/styles/` - Global CSS
- `src/config/` - Env config
- `src/assets/` - Images, icons, fonts

## 🔧 Backend Java Service (`services/{service}/`)
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/domain/` - Pure business logic
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/application/usecase/` - Use cases
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/application/port/` - Port interfaces
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/infrastructure/persistence/` - DB
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/infrastructure/kafka/` - Kafka
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/infrastructure/security/` - JWT, OAuth
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/interfaces/rest/` - REST controllers
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/interfaces/event/` - Event consumers
- `src/main/java/com/ioes/{service}/config/` - Spring config
- `src/main/resources/db/migration/` - Flyway migrations
- `src/test/java/` - Tests
- `k8s/` - K8s manifests riêng
- `Dockerfile`, `pom.xml`

## 🟢 Backend Node.js Service (`services/{service}/`)
- `src/main.ts` - Entry point
- `src/app.module.ts` - Root module
- `src/modules/{feature}/` - Feature modules
  - `{feature}.module.ts`
  - `{feature}.controller.ts`
  - `{feature}.service.ts`
  - `{feature}.repository.ts`
  - `entities/`
  - `dto/`
  - `guards/`, `interceptors/`
  - `*.spec.ts`
- `src/common/` - Filters, guards, decorators
- `src/database/` - Migrations
- `src/config/` - Configuration
- `test/` - Tests
- `k8s/`, `Dockerfile`, `package.json`

## 🐍 Backend Python Service (`services/ai-suite/{service}/`)
- `src/{service_name}/main.py` - FastAPI entry
- `src/{service_name}/api/` - Routes
- `src/{service_name}/models/` - ML models
- `src/{service_name}/services/` - Business logic
- `src/{service_name}/schemas/` - Pydantic models
- `src/{service_name}/core/` - config, logging, security
- `tests/`, `notebooks/`, `k8s/`, `Dockerfile`, `pyproject.toml`

## 📚 Shared Libraries (`libs/`)
- `common-library/` - Java (DTOs, exceptions, JWT, Kafka)
- `common-node/` - Node.js (filters, guards, decorators)
- `common-python/` - Python (schemas, OpenTelemetry)

## 📦 Frontend Packages (`packages/`)
- `ui-kit/` - Shared UI components
- `api-client/` - Generated API client
- `shared-types/` - Shared TypeScript types
- `eslint-config/` - Shared ESLint
- `tsconfig/` - Shared TypeScript
- `utils/` - Shared utilities

## 🚫 CẤM
- Tạo file `.js` (chỉ `.ts`/`.tsx`)
- Tạo thư mục ngoài cấu trúc
- Tạo file Java ở root của service
- Tạo file Python ở root của service
- File rác (draft, debug) trong code

Xem chi tiết: `@/docs/01-business/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`
